            "review_title": "Review at Gac Cafe",
            "review_text": "Philippe Lorarut\n2 contributions\n0\nTypical low chair local cafe\nAug 2023 • Couples\nOne of my favorite coffee shops in town! The staff is very friendly and welcoming.\nI love the milk foam tea and coffee with coconut, and I especially enjoyed the Vietnamese coffee with condensed milk and sunflower seeds.\n22k vnd. The prices are reasonable, and the ambiance is cozy and inviting.\nI would definitely recommend this coffee shop to anyone looking for a great place to relax and enjoy a cup of coffee.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 22, 2023",
